            </note>
            <note corresp="#d654-f2" n="2" xml:id="d654-f2-content">
                <p>The original financial appendix of NSC 125/5 was
                    not destroyed in the copy in S/S–NSC files, lot 63 D 351, NSC 125 Series.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
